<!-- Racks screen - list of every monitored rack
     Deliverable 2 steps 4, 5, 23, 24, 25: full design without functionality.
     Each card shows the rack image, name, location, status and its 4 sensor readings.
     The filter chips and the sample racks are for the design only; real racks
     will come from the cloud database in a later deliverable.
     @author Krushna
     @date 2026-10-03 -->
